{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_2685dfc29930","title":"securitainment","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497510&idx=1&sn=b37bcc60c5723580706c85c07d607882&chksm=9ab52f49c45ad1543abbcc339c18bd143464611ef384c891255fd7858a0413ca706926f2f4dd&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"Knowledge is power. 致力于为技术专家和安全爱好者提供安全分析、案例研究和最新安全动态。**所有文章仅限技术研究**","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"securitainment","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUSH8Nb3Hz5RicpuhRIBLeWQ0jwGn1uYDUiabEko2BVhv8F8Ilrarr0vavNX6VFibFAliahgkc6uuGfM%2F0","updated":"2026-11-23T04:50:45.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497510:1","title":"HTB PingPong 靶机：跨林信任的六段提权链","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497510&idx=1&sn=b37bcc60c5723580706c85c07d607882&chksm=9ab52f49c45ad1543abbcc339c18bd143464611ef384c891255fd7858a0413ca706926f2f4dd&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"作者：0xdfPingPong 是一台假定失陷 (assume breach) 的 Active Direct","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSjbvU6qDwLnzVYnIPj5xiamjMlbxYyKSwawkyics0icdawbyUGwdicVerIqeMzpJTbDc5pppGgnhV7SlJpxFwibqEbeaUuk7M9SJjiak%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T04:50:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497510:2","title":"攻破 Muse：利用浏览器操作窃取私密对话","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497510&idx=2&sn=a6473d3584f06a7139fc9d4cda94e7ad&chksm=9a894ea84d080e992e77a8bab7e18bf1189c500e1e785ba68c64db25ef4bb6d775c329c907fa&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"NebuSec 研究团队近期对 Meta Muse 展开了调查。Muse 是一款云端托管的 AI 助手，被设计为在隔离的虚拟机 (VM) 中运行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSg6VoHUOSmR4L7zVTfASopXhxOOxrZeOF1EBW8NBcFpevGf1iakD0UOCBicLkNQn58nyxNpalsQyXXaQAupVjluiaDRgCicRjqtjEY%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T04:50:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497351:1","title":"AI 时代的漏洞发现与利用趋势","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497351&idx=1&sn=04d656bf477d01c1d9742d126d1378a2&chksm=9ac7d0dcd4c55c1ea5947725d78c4475bcf46758527b66f41b3644155fac9634bd8d88efac2b&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSj1Tsu8zERgQpPPWfBQ9h7QC2yjw0PsPevc1ZprmOpYh5Atyq8QTcUOFzuxLSOvy3BSJWKqGDKVWn60j0a91o3qlyao5qZ57CQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T11:11:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497350:1","title":"两次点击，一个信标：滥用 ClickOnce 部署实现初始访问","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497350&idx=1&sn=9ad159b39813026ae84c643a5dde1b6f&chksm=9a4d1b1e85984dedf38525cccd6dab1e5938261aeebc68ba227d110c5674bff9599ecfc3f11d&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"大家好，我是 Akchhat，我们又回来了。这次我打算试另一种初始访问 (Initial Access) 技术，我一直想动手试的就是 ClickOnce部署。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSiadY4dZxia2AkBUlEYCl1kWMSn4dMEkiaKBmjLDpfXYRoZPoTZEhosL1Gd0sC0gXAT29xSod66G5pEKkJcXxEO36BLo84Q0hlVbs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T08:50:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497349:1","title":"循环之内：五套从不请求许可的 AI 攻击框架","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497349&idx=1&sn=d8f82b17614fac22783015bfebf77f21&chksm=9aa1bf66080329acf4ad72f09c6f568c4f7f319d7c49ffca664b4bcc0f3235b435597679fd3b&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"五套 AI 攻击框架，GitHub 合计六万星。它们早不是红队玩具，已经进了真实入侵。\n\nARTEX、Cairn、HexStrike、PentAGI 被 Google 和 Mandiant 在事件响应里撞见过。微软把 ARTEX 算到了 Storm-0940 头上。CyberStrikeAI 也被追到过一台服务器。\n\n真正危险的是这套循环：大模型坐指挥位，自己规划下一步，分给多个智能体干活。缺啥工具就现装，几秒一次往前推。GTIG 测到 ARTEX 每次推进只要 2 到 25 秒。NorForge 看到 Cairn 从开始到得手，平均不到 23 小时。\n\n最扎心的是，这五套默认都不在代码里查授权。全靠提示词声明\"我有权限\"。ARTEX、CyberStrikeAI 只拦了 .gov 和 .edu，剩下随便扫。而且它们被拦后会换代理、换地址接着来。\n\n想防住它，别盯 IP 和指纹——版本一更新就变了。要看行为：同一个身份短时间内连用 curl、Python、AWS CLI，还伴随大量 API 调用。检测规则得提前接好自动封禁，不然等人工反应过来，机器早跑完一轮了。","content":"<p>五套 AI 攻击框架，GitHub 合计六万星。它们早不是红队玩具，已经进了真实入侵。<br /><br />ARTEX、Cairn、HexStrike、PentAGI 被 Google 和 Mandiant 在事件响应里撞见过。微软把 ARTEX 算到了 Storm-0940 头上。CyberStrikeAI 也被追到过一台服务器。<br /><br />真正危险的是这套循环：大模型坐指挥位，自己规划下一步，分给多个智能体干活。缺啥工具就现装，几秒一次往前推。GTIG 测到 ARTEX 每次推进只要 2 到 25 秒。NorForge 看到 Cairn 从开始到得手，平均不到 23 小时。<br /><br />最扎心的是，这五套默认都不在代码里查授权。全靠提示词声明&quot;我有权限&quot;。ARTEX、CyberStrikeAI 只拦了 .gov 和 .edu，剩下随便扫。而且它们被拦后会换代理、换地址接着来。<br /><br />想防住它，别盯 IP 和指纹——版本一更新就变了。要看行为：同一个身份短时间内连用 curl、Python、AWS CLI，还伴随大量 API 调用。检测规则得提前接好自动封禁，不然等人工反应过来，机器早跑完一轮了。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSj3xqpRzb3tuQe1wcicfTPaX8qATXmYkLVJzrWjLbq6Scl1xaxINt6JvNaIJRibnjtVGFDia1qV7S9xfh6KPqo3jTwVQ6Omsicz8oM%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nSjz6FvVUENNZnc9uIgQvyWR4K8fBOv65JOm7PQT9kymw4PmBa2iak185OtSaj18lyb5N2bTiaVSrPiaGu3HmRGeCpS1qAAy1uhibzc%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShP53IXzhwOm2WVkOmicm2C4wLOpwT4vbmKPp4W1LpictlqdI3c9hMOySp6fVWCAmuGSa6nicAASsNVibJg38meehxZjFTZqQakicEw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShMG7DkMdOSVY2cyhZMbD6xiaibL49j05j6ftL8kKGmXicQrUKfPeibvS9oypicEia1OwEBn83zkVu81icusUlQXtv8739Xr3q3Chaop8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.