,"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nShKY6tA5kSPUiaLUk9797ywBSrkInkg6y8Xb2zmX0by4khUWUB6nbU4k2gia60X23icGNINCazVSV2nNWR3Ykz5ia7GNicEeQEMeRyU%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2Fh4gtbB74nSjXfVhcNVttpWyFcnIIt0Bpibg5yaLKRJm7wreEoyFkpW7O7Fmh9LU8TpaMEiaGQgTribKfBIZ5f919F9XpWldbzRxG7shZQia26HE%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-18T06:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497033:1","title":"两个 SOC 的故事：两次红队评估带来的启示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497033&idx=1&sn=3997f6d00b99ba091687c970c48b3ea2&chksm=9a89703823775821b90ee7cd612de93adc26bcc551c91ea1a8537e58f813529249c664b477ae&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"CISA 拿两家单位做红队攻防测试，结果天差地别。\n\n两家都被打进了内网。但 A 家毫无察觉，B 家十分钟就掐断了攻击。\n\nA 家输在管理乱：告警满天飞，真攻击反而被淹没了。多个安全团队各看各的屏幕，谁也不通气。出事了连系统归谁管都不知道，只能干瞪眼。\n\nB 家赢在反应快：钓鱼邮件刚中招，十分钟就隔离了电脑。云上异常登录一触发，账号立马被封。不过 B 家底子也虚：明文密码、权限给太大、没开多因素认证，全被黑客钻了空子。\n\n真正该补的课：\n工具得调教：建好正常行为基线，过滤掉日常噪音。\n权责得划清：安全人员必须有权直接终端断网，不用层层请示。\n云和 OT 得盯紧：定期查查过大的应用权限和长期不换的密钥。\n\n说白了，光买一堆安全工具没用，关键得有人会用、敢处置。","content":"<p>CISA 拿两家单位做红队攻防测试，结果天差地别。<br /><br />两家都被打进了内网。但 A 家毫无察觉，B 家十分钟就掐断了攻击。<br /><br />A 家输在管理乱：告警满天飞，真攻击反而被淹没了。多个安全团队各看各的屏幕，谁也不通气。出事了连系统归谁管都不知道，只能干瞪眼。<br /><br />B 家赢在反应快：钓鱼邮件刚中招，十分钟就隔离了电脑。云上异常登录一触发，账号立马被封。不过 B 家底子也虚：明文密码、权限给太大、没开多因素认证，全被黑客钻了空子。<br /><br />真正该补的课：<br />工具得调教：建好正常行为基线，过滤掉日常噪音。<br />权责得划清：安全人员必须有权直接终端断网，不用层层请示。<br />云和 OT 得盯紧：定期查查过大的应用权限和长期不换的密钥。<br /><br />说白了，光买一堆安全工具没用，关键得有人会用、敢处置。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSgibDPLAOo8I8G1toaaZiccUBpGRBJb029bwKicPRBbAdrWo06uCP1gWiaGJMrOH7Y8JI2Tuln58iatjM0KicicGKVVrkqSDnjX6JEvxY%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSia9BUW3y8YxjvTBPsqxyueguFGfAt1WSfgmaXxw2V2RUSka62OWYtI992I4hib1HBjQwzhHSywY5GADeaMFxBJAmWlHibXVUiaHfE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSgibDPLAOo8I8G1toaaZiccUBpGRBJb029bwKicPRBbAdrWo06uCP1gWiaGJMrOH7Y8JI2Tuln58iatjM0KicicGKVVrkqSDnjX6JEvxY%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-18T06:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497340:1","title":"循环之内：五套从不请求许可的 AI 攻击框架","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497340&idx=1&sn=7d9f269b37c470b649a1ae83d71132f4&chksm=9a64433929aa8a9ab9543c9fdaad75c8cc2791c4a7a4facb9b36da0d5bef8a5f704bd9e7429a&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSiazFwOCq9RfRCB6AF2h1xQIkTmDBQW2RdlT9RjmwJmAWgy1ntArqE5X6cjRg0d4xqziaeQlv0v6M72eQS1aALj5lRN8tc6XJTCs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T04:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497283:1","title":"我们如何抵御一次 AI 驱动的攻击","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497283&idx=1&sn=32dca74cdac78184474a197dd4b63fe5&chksm=9a76c438ec5ba566053bc416c32200e325d8c4f32e36fa1548ba79705683bcb03100a3a8e57d&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"一次真实的 AI 驱动攻击：ARTEX 的 LLM agent 以机器速度窃取密钥、建隧道、投毒部署。防御方用自己的 agent 并行处理日志、由人掌控，几天内夺回环境。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fh4gtbB74nSjcld7tudELa6fIBcbGKwMXSiaIYJHwbcVcrsDlEZm3tA01AgNvZvRzpBxqicIaCeiaCt6ibRicnSNoK0GCHxnibPB4SEbFVpgqzmjZo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-17T06:50:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxODM5ODQzNQ%3D%3D:2247497283:2","title":"今日学到 nsenter","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxODM5ODQzNQ==&mid=2247497283&idx=2&sn=f82ba359eea2d7f7d2ee5d89670eb697&chksm=9a8247ef894384b3125daeab3de2b2c81eab18d076a184426419e7e292915a5e234b2f0c91d5&scene=126&sessionid=1795485013#rd","description":"在 K8S 节点上